id: pm-glossary-budget
title: Read the stored budget setting only when no explicit budget is given
description: Validate a stored output_budget only when no explicit budget transport is supplied; retain refusal of invalid fallback values. Reject sparse and oversized submitted arrays before schema validation.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
